 props",".",[354,355],"component-example",{"name":356},"checkbox-values",[358,359,360,370],"ul",{},[361,362,363,364,366,367,369],"li",{},"When the bound value is not ",[299,365,317],{},", the checkbox shows unchecked. In the example, changing only ",[299,368,317],{}," makes the existing value no longer match, so it shows unchecked.",[361,371,372,373,375,376,352],{},"A native form submission sends ",[299,374,317],{}," instead of the browser's default ",[299,377,378],{},"on",[309,380,382],{"id":381},"label","Label",[296,384,385,387,388,391,392,352],{},[299,386,381],{}," defaults to \"Enable\" (\"啟用\" in Traditional Chinese), switching with the locale, and can be overridden with the ",[299,389,390],{},"checkbox.label"," text; see ",[348,393,47],{"href":394},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",[354,396],{"name":397},"checkbox-label",[296,399,400,401,404],{},"The label shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[348,402,217],{"href":403},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press that shows the tooltip does not change the checked state.",[309,406,408],{"id":407},"description","Description",[296,410,411,413],{},[299,412,407],{}," shows below the label. Without a description, the height matches an input of the same size; with one, the checkbox grows and the description wraps, while the first line still lines up with fields next to it that have no description.",[354,415],{"name":416},"checkbox-description",[309,418,420],{"id":419},"color-and-icon","Color and icon",[296,422,423,424,342,427,430,431,352],{},"Uses the ",[299,425,426],{},"color",[299,428,429],{},"icon"," (the checked icon) of ",[299,432,433],{},"UCheckbox",[354,435],{"name":436},"checkbox-color",[309,438,440],{"id":439},"size-and-states","Size and states",[296,442,443,444,447],{},"The frame height matches an input of the same size. While loading, a spinner of the same size replaces the checkbox and it is disabled. See ",[348,445,102],{"href":446},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[354,449],{"name":450},"checkbox-states",[304,452,454],{"id":453},"examples","Examples",[309,456,458],{"id":457},"next-to-an-input","Next to an input",[296,460,461,462,465,466,469],{},"Inside a flex container, the wrapper shrinks with the available space and truncates the label. To show the full label, set ",[299,463,464],{},"ui.wrapper"," to ",[299,467,468],{},"shrink-0","; a label wider than the container is still truncated with a tooltip.",[354,471],{"name":472},"checkbox-inline",[309,474,476],{"id":475},"input-next-to-the-label","Input next to the label",[296,478,479,480,483,484,487,488,491,492,495,496,500],{},"Put an input next to the label with ",[299,481,482],{},"#append",". When the input is focused, call ",[299,485,486],{},"check()"," from the slot props to check the box too, and use ",[299,489,490],{},"labelId"," as the input's ",[299,493,494],{},"aria-labelledby",". Clicking non-interactive parts of the appended content does not change the checked state; see ",[348,497,499],{"href":498},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox-group#item-append-content","Item append content"," for details.",[354,502],{"name":503},"checkbox-append",[309,505,507],{"id":506},"must-be-checked","Must be checked",[296,509,510,511,514,515,517,518,521],{},"For fields that must be checked, such as agreeing to terms, use ",[299,512,513],{},"v.check"," to check that the bound value equals ",[299,516,317],{}," (not ",[299,519,520],{},"v.literal",", which would narrow the UForm state type).",[354,523],{"name":524},"checkbox-validation",[304,526,528],{"id":527},"props","Props",[530,531],"component-props",{"name":532},"ShuoCheckbox",[296,534,535,536,539,540,543,544,543,547,543,550,543,553,342,556,559,560,562,563,565],{},"See ",[348,537,102],{"href":538},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[299,541,542],{},"size",", ",[299,545,546],{},"disabled",[299,548,549],{},"loading",[299,551,552],{},"skeleton",[299,554,555],{},"id",[299,557,558],{},"name",". The default of ",[299,561,381],{}," can be overridden with the ",[299,564,390],{}," text.",[296,567,568,569,572,573,342,576,579,580,584],{},"Nuxt UI's ",[299,570,571],{},"variant"," (card), ",[299,574,575],{},"indicator",[299,577,578],{},"highlight"," are not supported, so that a frame does not make the option taller and break the height alignment with inputs; see ",[348,581,583],{"href":582},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#built-on-nuxt-ui","Built on Nuxt UI"," for why.",[304,586,588],{"id":587},"slots","Slots",[590,591,592,606],"table",{},[593,594,595],"thead",{},[596,597,598,602,604],"tr",{},[599,600,601],"th",{},"Slot",[599,603,528],{},[599,605,408],{},[607,608,609],"tbody",{},[596,610,611,617,628],{},[612,613,614],"td",{},[299,615,616],{},"append",[612,618,619,543,622,543,624,543,626],{},[299,620,621],{},"checked",[299,623,546],{},[299,625,490],{},[299,627,486],{},[612,629,630,631],{},"Content next to the label; see ",[348,632,499],{"href":498},[304,634,636],{"id":635},"styling","Styling",[296,638,639,642,643,645,646,653,654,657],{},[299,640,641],{},"ui"," accepts every slot of Nuxt UI ",[299,644,433],{},", merged as described in ",[348,647,649,650,652],{"href":648},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Ftheming#per-component-ui-prop","Per-component ",[299,651,641],{}," prop",", plus ",[299,655,656],{},"wrapper",":",[590,659,660,672],{},[593,661,662],{},[596,663,664,666,669],{},[599,665,601],{},[599,667,668],{},"Part",[599,670,671],{},"Built-in styles",[607,673,674,688,704,718],{},[596,675,676,680,683],{},[612,677,678],{},[299,679,656],{},[612,681,682],{},"Outer wrapper that measures truncation, holds the tooltip and positions the loading icon",[612,684,685],{},[299,686,687],{},"relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full min-w-0 align-top",[596,689,690,695,698],{},[6